Stable Audio 3 (Stability AI)
https://huggingface.co/stabilityai
The sources of the Unfairlight factory voices (machines/unfairlight/assets/)
were made with Stable Audio 3 Small SFX and Small Music, run locally, under
the Stability AI Community License, which gives the maker the outputs. They
were then cut, looped and stored as 8-bit CMI voice RAM, and are released
under CC0 1.0. Each voice's preset names the model, prompt and seed. No
Stability AI model or code is part of Slab.

