Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL)
https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL
CC0 1.0 / public domain. A few instruments ship with Slab as 16-bit mono
FLAC (machines/sampler/assets/vcsl/: two pianos, the TX81Z FM piano, a
harpsichord, marimba, kalimba, ocarina and three drum kits made from its
percussion); the rest is the VCSL pack, which downloads it into the user's
library. Factory sounds made from VCSL recordings are credited in their
assets' notes.

